			<TRAN name="obpds_srvc_421r" title="SPIN 서비스 약정 ID 조회" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="40" _ulen="32" >

CSNO^고객번호^10^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" occurs="30" inout="out" _len="173" _ulen="129" >

CSNO^고객번호^10^0^0^0^0^0^0
APP_TYPE_NO^어플리케이션유형번호^11^0^7^0^0^0^0
ELFN_ID^전자금융ID^20^0^0^0^0^0^0
USE_YN^사용여부^1^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="NextBlock1" inout="next" _len="79" _ulen="63" >

CSNO^고객번호^10^0^0^0^0^0^0
ELFN_ID^전자금융ID^20^0^0^0^0^0^0

